{"articleNo":"200985","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=200985&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"환경영향평가사 자격검정 일정 및 인력풀 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.11.27","hit":"5904","attachments":[{"name":"(붙임2) 환경영향평가사 시험위원 인력풀 등록 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=200985&attachNo=79478"},{"name":"(붙임1) 환경영향평가사 자격검정 일정 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=200985&attachNo=79536"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">환경부와 한국환경산업기술원은 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">「환경영향평가법」 제63조에 따라 환경영향평가업의 총괄 분야 전문기술인력인</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\"환경영향평가사\" 배출을 위해 환경영향평가사 자격시험 검정사업을 운영하고 있습니다.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">이에, 환경영향평가사 자격검정 일정 및 인력풀 등록을 붙임과 같이 안내합니다.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">환경영향평가사란?</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 환경현황조사, 환경영향 예측/분석, 환경보전방안의 설정 및 대안평가를 통하여 환경영향평가서 작성에 관한 업무를</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;수행하는 사람</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ 문의처</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 한국환경산업기술원 T.02-2284-1727 / </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.ceia.re.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">www.ceia.re.kr</span></font></u></a></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 환경영향평가사 자격검정 일정 안내 1부.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 환경영향평가사 시험위원 인력풀 등록 안내 1부.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
